   ├── YearMonth (201, 202)
   ├── Product
   ├── TotalSales (SUM)
   ├── TotalQuantity (SUM)

2. Set up relationship
   Aggregation relates to Dimensions same as detail

3. Power BI automatically uses aggregate
   when appropriate (smart selection)
```

