### Essential Measures

```
// Total Sales
Total Sales = SUM(Sales[Amount])

// Average Order Value
AOV = AVERAGE(Sales[Amount])

// Year-over-Year Growth
YoY Growth = 
    [Sales This Year] - [Sales Last Year]
    / [Sales Last Year]

// Rank
Rank = RANK([Sales], ALL(Regions[Region]))

// Running Total
Running Total = CALCULATE(
    SUM(Sales[Amount]),
    FILTER(ALL(Dates), Dates[Date] <= MAX(Dates[Date]))
)

// Percentage of Total
% of Total = [Total Sales] / CALCULATE([Total Sales], ALL(Regions))

// Count Distinct
Unique Customers = DISTINCTCOUNT(Orders[CustomerID])

// Previous Period
Previous Month Sales = CALCULATE(
    [Total Sales],
    DATEADD(Dates[Date], -1, MONTH)
)
```

### Common Transformations in Power Query

```
// Remove duplicates
Table.Distinct(Source)

// Filter rows
Table.SelectRows(Source, each [Amount] > 1000)

// Add column
Table.AddColumn(Source, "NewColumn", each [Col1] & [Col2])

// Merge queries
Table.NestedJoin(Table1, {"Key"}, Table2, {"Key"}, "NewTable")

// Group by
Table.Group(Source, {"Category"}, {{"Sum", each List.Sum([Amount]), type number}})

// Pivot
Table.Pivot(Source, List.Distinct(Source[Category]), "Category", "Amount")
```

