   - New analysis = new fact table
   - Dimensions stay stable
   - Minimal changes needed

4. Maintenance
   - Facts grow predictably
   - Dims change rarely
   - Easy to troubleshoot
```

**Star Schema vs Snowflake:**
```
Star: Flat (one level of dimensions)
